    $s$Governance/compliance document distinct from the Cat 2 engagement CONTRACT (draft_engagement_contract = the client agreement itself) and the operational SOP (draft_sop_process_doc). A privacy policy is business-wide data-governance, not a client agreement or a process doc, so it does not duplicate either (§18). Mechanic: gather declared business context + generic policy structure, generate a plain-language draft with a mandatory NOT-LEGAL-ADVICE disclaimer in-copy, file as a draft for human approval, render for attorney review. IP-clean: no branded legal framework, anchor person, or source-repo name in any field (§14/§62). Interpreter honesty: Paige drafts and persists a draft only — she cannot publish, file with any authority, or determine legal/compliance status (§13).$s$,
