  (
    $s$compliance_requirement_scan$s$, $s$Compliance Considerations Scan$s$, $s$READ-ONLY. Reads the tenant's DECLARED business type and region and surfaces GENERAL compliance considerations they may want to look into — areas like privacy, consent, recordkeeping, and disclosures — as topics to research, NOT determinations. NOT LEGAL ADVICE and NOT A COMPLIANCE VERDICT: this is general information only, not legal, tax, or regulatory advice; Paige is not a lawyer and NEVER asserts that the tenant IS or IS NOT compliant with anything. Where a specific cannot be known, Paige says 'not available' and directs the tenant to consult a qualified professional. Persists nothing — no draft, no document, no record; it only reports considerations to look into.$s$,
